INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_f4af395990015Df5miVLpBRRBF','ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW',251,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW","part":{"id":"prt_f4af21b88001iTZD0rRAsYd7UH","sessionID":"ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW","messageID":"msg_f4af1fa1c001qDKCAT2zK9wpa9","type":"tool","callID":"call_b73209aaea52431aa05654a1","tool":"task","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Find netmaker configuration","prompt":"Search the codebase at /home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto thoroughly for anything related to netmaker. Look for:\n\n1. Files with \"netmaker\" in the name (case-insensitive)\n2. Files containing \"netmaker\" in their content\n3. Network configuration files (WireGuard configs, network configs)\n4. Any `netmaker` related Rust modules, structs, or functions\n5. Check `deploy/` directory for netmaker service definitions\n6. Check any TOML, YAML, JSON config files for netmaker references\n7. Check `schemas/` directory for netmaker-related schemas\n\nReport everything you find with file paths, line numbers, and relevant content snippets.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_0b50dde15ffeiIVMOMejeSjJYV\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nHere is the comprehensive report of everything related to **netmaker** in this codebase.\n\n---\n\n## 1. Files with \"netmaker\" in the Name (case-insensitive)\n\n### A. Core Rust source files -- the two primary code modules\n\n| File | Role |\n|---|---|\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/netmaker.rs` | **Netmaker state plugin** (674 lines) -- D-Bus state plugin implementing `StatePlugin` for netclient management. Registers via `inventory`. |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-grpc-adapters/src/adapters/netmaker.rs` | **Netmaker gRPC adapter** (579 lines) -- bridges Netmaker HTTP REST API to gRPC via Unix domain socket at `/run/netmaker/api.sock`. |\n\n### B. Deploy / infrastructure definitions\n\n| File | Role |\n|---|---|\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/netmaker/incus-compose.yaml` | Incus-compose manifest -- defines `netmaker` (v1.6.0-ee), `mq`, `netmaker-ui`, `prometheus`, `grafana`, `netmaker-exporter` containers |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/netmaker/compose.yaml` | Same compose file (symlinked?) -- identical content with 176 lines |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/netmaker/install.sh` | Post-provisioning script (95 lines) -- removes NICs, registers sockets via gRPC, starts containers |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/netmaker/mosquitto.conf` | Mosquitto config -- loopback-only, no NIC |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/netmaker/host-mosquitto.conf` | Host-side mosquitto config |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/s6/wg-netmaker/run` | **s6 service definition** -- runs `netclient daemon` for the WireGuard mesh |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/s6/wg-netmaker/producer-for` | Declares `wg-netmaker-log` |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/s6/wg-netmaker/dependencies.d/gbr-wg` | Depends on `gbr-wg` service |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/s6/droid-daemon/dependencies.d/wg-netmaker` | Droid daemon depends on `wg-netmaker` |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/setup-hypervisor-netclient.sh` | Netclient hypervisor install script (70 lines) -- downloads binary, sets up s6 + OVS attach |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/base-components.md` (line 92) | Lists `netmaker` as a base plugin component |\n\n### C. Docs, handoffs, and planning\n\n| File | Role |\n|---|---|\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/netmaker.handoff` | Interactive handoff log -- incus-compose setup, no-NIC topology, xray routing |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/docs/handoff-2026-07-09-identity-sled-netmaker.md` | Handoff doc -- netmaker-pro recovery, identity_sled plugin, EMQX ExHook wiring |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/pitch/system-overview-netmaker-spin.md` | Pitch doc -- \"Netmaker as the spine\" overview |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/pitch/GhostBridge-Netmaker.html` | HTML pitch page (GhostBridge x Netmaker) |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/pitch/GhostBridge-Netmaker.pdf` | PDF version |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/pitch/GhostBridge-Netmaker-pitch.md` | Markdown pitch |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/pitch/GhostBridge-Netmaker-use-case-deck.html` | HTML use case deck |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/pitch/GhostBridge-Netmaker-use-case-deck.pdf` | PDF use case deck |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/pitch/GhostBridge-Netmaker-engineer-deck.html` | HTML engineer deck |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/pitch/GhostBridge-Netmaker-engineer-deck.pdf` | PDF engineer deck |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/pitch/GhostBridge-Netmaker-email.html` | HTML email |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/pitch/GhostBridge-Netmaker-email.pdf` | PDF email |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/pitch/GhostBridge-Netmaker-email-body.txt` | Text email body |\n| `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/enrollment.key` | Netmaker enrollment key JSON (network: `3tched`, token present) |\n\n---\n\n## 2. Rust Modules, Structs, and Functions\n\n### Module declarations\n\n- **`/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/mod.rs` line 51** -- `pub mod netmaker;`\n- **`/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-grpc-adapters/src/adapters/mod.rs` line 3** -- `pub mod netmaker;`\n\n### Public exports\n\n- **`/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/mod.rs` line 120** -- `pub use netmaker::{NetmakerConfig, NetmakerPlugin};`\n- **`/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-plugins/src/lib.rs` line 101** -- `NetmakerConfig, NetmakerPlugin` re-exported\n- **`/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/plugin_scaffold_helpers.rs` line 32** -- `pub(crate) use super::netmaker::netmaker_schema as netmaker_plugin_schema;`\n- **`/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-grpc-adapters/src/server.rs` lines 9, 28, 50** -- imports `NetmakerAdapter`, registers `NetmakerServiceServer<NetmakerAdapter>`\n\n### Structs (in `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/netmaker.rs`)\n\n| Struct | Lines | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| `NetmakerConfig` | 17-27 | `enabled`, `default_network`, `enrollment_token`, `api_endpoint` |\n| `NetmakerNetwork` | 30-44 | `name`, `connected`, `is_default`, `node_id`, `peers`, `address` |\n| `NetmakerState` | 47-70 | Full plugin state: `software`, `version`, `dependencies`, `installed`, `daemon_running`, `control_socket`, `networks`, `public_ip`, `config`, `tools` |\n| `NetmakerPlugin` | 153-155 | Plugin struct wrapping `NetmakerConfig` |\n| `ServiceController` | 74-77 | Enum (`S6 { connection }`) for managing netclient via D-Bus |\n\n### Input structs (in `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/netmaker.rs`)\n\n| Struct | Lines | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| `JoinNetworkInput` | 542-548 | `network`, `token` |\n| `LeaveNetworkInput` | 550-553 | `network` |\n| `ListNodesInput` | 555-558 | `network` |\n| `GetNodeInput` | 560-564 | `network`, `node_id` |\n| `UpdateNodeInput` | 566-571 | `network`, `node_id`, `payload` |\n| `ListNetworksInput` | 573-574 | (empty) |\n\n### Key functions\n\n| Function | File:Line | Description |\n|---|---|---|\n| `NetmakerPlugin::new()` | `netmaker.rs:158` | Constructor |\n| `NetmakerPlugin::check_netclient_installed()` | `netmaker.rs:163` | File-check for netclient binary |\n| `NetmakerPlugin::check_daemon_running()` | `netmaker.rs:169` | D-Bus check via s6 |\n| `NetmakerPlugin::join_network()` | `netmaker.rs:274` | Writes config + restarts netclient |\n| `NetmakerPlugin::leave_network()` | `netmaker.rs:287` | Writes config + restarts netclient |\n| `NetmakerPlugin::current_state()` | `netmaker.rs:299` | Returns default `NetmakerState` |\n| `NetmakerPlugin::get_networks()` | `netmaker.rs:207` | Reads `/etc/netclient/netclient.json` |\n| `netmaker_schema()` | `netmaker.rs:576` | Generates `PluginSchema` with 6 methods |\n| `NetmakerAdapter::new()` | `adapters/netmaker.rs:28` | Connects via `/run/netmaker/api.sock` |\n| `NetmakerAdapter::raw_get()` | `adapters/netmaker.rs:38` | HTTP/1.1 GET over UDS (CRLF-injection guarded) |\n| `NetmakerAdapter::get()` | `adapters/netmaker.rs:113` | GET single object (empty = not-found) |\n| `NetmakerAdapter::get_list()` | `adapters/netmaker.rs:127` | GET list (empty = valid empty list) |\n\n### StatePlugin trait implementation\n\n`NetmakerPlugin` implements `StatePlugin` in `netmaker.rs:347-537`:\n- `name()` returns `\"netmaker\"`, `version()` returns `\"1.0.0\"`\n- `schema()` returns `netmaker_schema()`\n- `capabilities()` -- supports rollback, checkpoints, verification, atomic ops\n- `calculate_diff()` -- diffs installed/enabled state and network membership\n- `apply_state()` -- installs/enables netclient, joins networks via D-Bus `s6-systemctl`\n- `verify_state()` -- always returns true (stub)\n- `create_checkpoint()` / `rollback()` -- checkpoint creates a snapshot; rollback returns error (\"not implemented\")\n\n### Schema methods (defined in `netmaker_schema()` at line 576)\n\n| Method | SideEffect | Subid | Capability |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| `join_network` | Mutation | `mut.network.netmaker.network.join@v1` | `cap.network.netmaker.network.join@v1` |\n| `leave_network` | Mutation | `mut.network.netmaker.network.leave@v1` | `cap.network.netmaker.network.leave@v1` |\n| `list_nodes` | Read | `obs.network.netmaker.nodes.list@v1` | `cap.network.netmaker.nodes.list@v1` |\n| `get_node` | Read | `obs.network.netmaker.node.get@v1` | `cap.network.netmaker.node.get@v1` |\n| `update_node` | Mutation | `mut.network.netmaker.node.update@v1` | `cap.network.netmaker.node.update@v1` |\n| `list_networks` | Read | `obs.network.netmaker.networks.list