- `ping()` — Ping (alive check)\n  - `task_completed` (signal) — Task completion notification\n  - `status_changed` (signal) — Status change notification\n\n**25. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-tools/src/builtin/agent_tool.rs` — Line 311**\n- **Interface:** `org.dbusmcp.Agent` (uses `#[zbus::interface]`)\n- **Struct:** `AgentDbusService`\n- **Methods:**\n  - `name()` — Agent name\n  - `description()` — Agent description\n  - `operations()` — List operations\n  - `execute(task_json)` — Execute task\n\n**26. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-agents/src/generator/template.rs` — Line 556**\n- **Interface:** `{interface_name}` (template — dynamic at code-generation time)\n- **Struct:** `{struct_name}` (template)\n- **Methods:**\n  - `execute(task_json)` — Execute a task safely (template-generated)\n\n---\n\n## 2. D-Bus Configuration Files\n\n### `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/dbus/org.opdbus.conf`\n- System bus configuration for `org.opdbus.*` namespace.\n- Root user + user `jeremy` have full ownership (`own_prefix=\"org.opdbus\"`).\n- Default policy allows sending to many sub-namespaces: `org.opdbus.v1.plugins`, `org.opdbus.Projection`, `org.opdbus.services`, `org.opdbus.network`, `org.opdbus.security`, `org.opdbus.config`, `org.opdbus.policy`, `org.opdbus.storage`, `org.opdbus.backup`, `org.opdbus.container`, `org.opdbus.virtualization`, `org.opdbus.monitoring`, `org.opdbus.hardware`, `org.opdbus.ipmi`, `org.opdbus.bmc`, `org.opdbus.cluster`, `org.opdbus.cms`, `org.opdbus.session`, `org.opdbus.directory`.\n\n### `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/dbus/org.dbusmcp.conf`\n- System bus configuration for `org.dbusmcp.*` (Agent) namespace.\n- Root and `op-dbus` user can own `org.dbusmcp` prefix.\n- Default policy allows sending to `org.dbusmcp.Agent` interface plus standard D-Bus introspection/Properties/Peer interfaces.\n\n### `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/op-dbus-services.conf`\n- Extended policy configuration installed at `/etc/dbus-1/system.d/op-dbus-services.conf`.\n- Granular read/write permissions organized by domain (config, network, hardware, container, session, policy, directory, ipmi, bmc).\n- Group-based policies for `opdbus-operators` and `opdbus-admins` with explicit denies for dangerous IPMI/BMC power operations.\n\n## 3. Service Definition Files\n\n### `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/services.conf`\n- Lists two registered services: `op-dbus` and `op-mcp`.\n\n### `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/deploy/ghostbridge/`\n- Contains systemd/s6 service definitions for the ghostbridge D-Bus session management infrastructure:\n  - `op-dbus.service`, `op-dbus.socket` — Primary D-Bus service\n  - `ghostbridge-session@.service` — Per-session services\n  - `ghostbridge-backup.service` / `ghostbridge-backup.timer` — Backup timer\n\n## 4. Interface Registration Points\n\nKey registration sites where D-Bus objects are served on the bus:\n\n| File | Path | Interface(s) |\n|---|---|---|\n| `op-dbus/src/s6_systemctl.rs:640` | `/org/opdbus/v1/plugins/s6/systemctl` | `org.opdbus.v1.S6.Systemctl` |\n| `op-projection/src/dbus_server.rs:558` | `/org/opdbus/v1/plugins` | `org.opdbus.v1.plugins` (ProjectionRoot) |\n| `op-projection/src/dbus_server.rs:396,606` | `/org/opdbus/v1/plugins/<plugin>[/...]` | `org.opdbus.v1.plugins.ProjectedObject` |\n| `op-assistant-grpc/src/dbus_service.rs:57` | configurable path | `ai.assistant.v1` |\n| `op-grpc-bridge/src/dbus_object.rs:115` | `/org/opdbus/v1/services/zeroclaw_axum_host` | `org.opdbus.v1.ZeroclawAxumHost` |\n| `op-grpc-bridge/src/schema_router.rs:183` | `/org/opdbus/v1/plugins/<id>` | `org.opdbus.v1.PluginV1` |\n| `op-grpc-bridge/src/schema_router.rs:249` | `/org/opdbus/v1/plugins/<id>/<child>` | `org.opdbus.v1.PluginChildV1` |\n| `op-grpc-bridge/src/zeroclaw_projection.rs:192,213` | `/org/opdbus/v1/zeroclaw/...` | `org.opdbus.v1.ModelRoute` / `org.opdbus.v1.Provider` |\n| `op-openvswitch-daemon/src/main.rs:129-145` | `/org/opdbus/rovs/jsonrpc`, `/org/opdbus/rovs/openflow`, `/org/opdbus/rovs/proxy`, `/org/opdbus/execution` | 4 OVS interfaces |\n| `op-xray-daemon/src/main.rs:119` | `/org/opdbus/v1/plugins/xray` | `opdbus.v1.Xray` |\n| `op-s6-systemctl/src/main.rs:66` | `/org/opdbus/v1/plugins/s6/systemctl` | `org.opdbus.v1.S6.Systemctl` |\n| `op-agents/src/dbus_service.rs:302,351` | `/org/dbusmcp/Agent/<Type>` | `org.dbusmcp.Agent` |\n| `op-state/src/dbus_server.rs` | dynamic per plugin | `org.opdbus.PluginV1` |\n| `op-plugins/src/registry.rs:130` | dynamic per plugin | per-plugin interfaces |\n\n## 5. Notes on Interface Annotation Styles\n\nTwo annotation styles are used:\n- **`#[interface(...)]`** (imported from `zbus::interface`) — Used in the majority of files (18 out of 26)\n- **`#[zbus::interface(...)]`** (fully qualified) — Used in 8 implementations across `op-assistant-grpc`, `op-grpc-bridge`, `op-state`, and `op-tools`/`op-agents`\n</task_result>\n</task>","title":"Find all D-Bus interfaces","metadata":{"parentSessionId":"ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW","sessionId":"ses_0b50de4a5ffe4VcC61gKDe06JR","model":{"modelID":"big-pickle","providerID":"opencode"},"truncated":false},"time":{"start":1783668808545,"end":1783668907257}}},"time":1783668907258}');
