INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_f4af6e0e0001I91AfkPOWEBGwV','ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW',341,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW","part":{"id":"prt_f4af6acb5001kQAgJoQpGqq6tH","sessionID":"ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW","messageID":"msg_f4af69fe6001hu0OVSWpnP3iou","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Fix compilation errors/warnings across the operation-dbus-proto Rust workspace, audit all D-Bus interfaces for correctness, and diagnose why OVS ports visible via `ip a` are not returned by OVS D-Bus commands.\n\n## Important Details\n- Workspace root: `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto`\n- Netmaker plugin has a **blocking API mismatch** (`get_node()` uses `.await` but trait method is `fn` not `async fn`)\n- `op-dbus-mirror` had garbage/duplicate code blocks after a properly closed `impl` block — identified and removed\n- `MirrorEvent::NonNet` variant was removed from the enum but `event_dispatcher.rs` still referenced it\n- **OVS port visibility issue**: ports show on bridge via `ip a show` but not via OVS D-Bus commands\n- OVS D-Bus pipeline: D-Bus method → `op-dbus-mirror` (`OvsdbDbusClient` via `rovs_proxy`) → `op-openvswitch-daemon` (passthrough) → `rovs_ovsdb::Client` → OVSDB socket (`/var/run/openvswitch/db.sock`)\n- Multiple OVSDB client implementations exist: `rovs_proxy.rs` (high-level D-Bus routed), `ovsdb.rs` (raw zbus `Transact`), `ovsdb.rs` in op-jsonrpc (direct JSON-RPC), `ovsdb_jsonrpc.rs` (minimal), `ovs_netlink.rs` (kernel netlink)\n- `list_ports` D-Bus method takes a bridge name string, calls `self.client.list_ports(&bridge).await`, returns JSON string\n- `op-openvswitch-daemon/src/dbus.rs`: daemon is **pure passthrough** — knows nothing about bridges/ports/containers, only proxies raw `rovs-jsonrpc`/`rovs-openflow` primitives\n- Daemon state: `DaemonState` holds `ovsdb: Arc<Mutex<Option<Client>>>` (lazily initialized), `socket_path`, `of_conns`, `next_of_id`\n- The `Transact` method on daemon validates at least one operation exists and passes `ops` straight to `client.transact(ops).await`\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Fixed `op-dbus-mirror/src/jsonrpc_interface.rs`: removed 55 lines of dead/duplicate code (lines 161-215) and unused imports\n- Fixed `op-dbus-mirror/src/event_dispatcher.rs:152`: removed stale `MirrorEvent::NonNet` match arm\n- Fixed `op-identity/src/host_identity.rs:11`: removed unused `verify_session_proof` import\n- Fixed `op-identity/src/registration.rs:9`: removed unused `RngCore` import\n- Fixed `op-identity/src/bin/op-identity-sled.rs:3`: removed unused `read_schema_blob` import\n- Verified `cargo check -p op-dbus-mirror` — compiles cleanly\n- Verified `cargo check -p op-identity` — compiles cleanly\n- Discovered all 26 D-Bus interfaces across the workspace\n- Discovered all netmaker-related files\n- Explored full OVS D-Bus query pipeline architecture (3 OVSDB clients, 2 D-Bus paths, 1 netlink path)\n- Read `op-openvswitch-daemon/src/dbus.rs` — confirmed pure passthrough design with no identity filtering on jsonrpc/openflow paths\n\n### Active\n- Diagnosing why OVS D-Bus `list_ports` doesn''t show ports visible via `ip a show` — investigation in progress\n- Full workspace audit of all D-Bus interface configurations and netmaker setup\n\n### Blocked\n- `op-plugins/src/state_plugins/netmaker.rs:317`: `get_node()` calls `.await` on `self.netmaker_client.get_node()` but trait `StatePlugin` method is synchronous — needs async trait or runtime blocking wrapper\n\n## Next Move\n1. Investigate the OVSDB query in `list_ports` — check what table/columns are requested and whether the OVSDB response is being filtered or mapped incorrectly\n2. Check `rovs_ovsdb::Client::list_ports` implementation for query construction and response parsing\n3. Compare `ip a` (kernel-level interface info) vs OVSDB `Bridge` table port column to identify the disconnect\n4. Fix the `netmaker.rs` async/sync mismatch\n5. Run `cargo check` on full workspace\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `crates/op-dbus-mirror/src/jsonrpc_interface.rs`: D-Bus mirror — `list_ports`, `list_bridges` methods\n- `crates/op-dbus-mirror/src/event_dispatcher.rs`: fixed stale NonNet match arm\n- `crates/op-openvswitch-daemon/src/dbus.rs`: OVS daemon — pure passthrough, `Transact` method, `DaemonState`\n- `crates/op-network/src/rovs_proxy.rs`: `OvsdbDbusClient` high-level wrapper via D-Bus\n- `crates/op-network/src/ovsdb.rs`: alternate `OvsdbClient` via raw zbus `Transact`\n- `crates/op-jsonrpc/src/ovsdb.rs`: `OvsdbDbusClient` direct JSON-RPC to `/var/run/openvswitch/db.sock`\n- `crates/op-jsonrpc/src/ovsdb_jsonrpc.rs`: minimal OVSDB JSON-RPC client\n- `crates/op-network/src/ovs_netlink.rs`: `OvsNetlinkClient` kernel netlink path\n- `crates/op-identity/src/host_identity.rs`: fixed unused import\n- `crates/op-identity/src/registration.rs`: fixed unused import\n- `crates/op-identity/src/bin/op-identity-sled.rs`: fixed unused import\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/netmaker.rs`: netmaker state plugin — async/sync mismatch bug\n- `crates/op-grpc-adapters/src/adapters/netmaker.rs`: netmaker gRPC adapter\n- `deploy/netmaker/compose.yaml`: netmaker container stack (v1.6.0-ee)","time":{"start":1783669107893,"end":1783669121247}},"time":1783669121248}');
