INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_f4afc6da40010d2am8MvlJk8UO','ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW',646,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW","part":{"id":"prt_f4afc3d67001WIr65FnFElXjSq","sessionID":"ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW","messageID":"msg_f4afc3662001TUHNatePNVp348","type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Fix compilation errors/warnings across the operation-dbus-proto Rust workspace, audit all D-Bus interfaces for correctness, diagnose why OVS ports visible via `ip a` are not returned by OVS D-Bus commands, and assess cognitive MCP system integration.\n\n## Important Details\n- Workspace root: `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-propo`\n- Netmaker plugin has a **blocking API mismatch** (`get_node()` uses `.await` but trait method is `fn` not `async fn`)\n- `op-dbus-mirror` had garbage/duplicate code blocks — identified and removed\n- `MirrorEvent::NonNet` variant was removed but `event_dispatcher.rs` still referenced it\n- **OVS port visibility issue**: ports show on bridge via `ip a show` but not via OVS D-Bus commands\n- OVS D-Bus pipeline: D-Bus method → `op-dbus-mirror` (`OvsdbDbusClient` via `rovs_proxy`) → `op-openvswitch-daemon` (passthrough) → `rovs_ovsdb::Client` → OVSDB socket (`/var/run/openvswitch/db.sock`)\n- `op-openvswitch-daemon/src/dbus.rs`: daemon is **pure passthrough** — knows nothing about bridges/ports, only proxies raw primitives\n- **Identity sled status**: binary exists at `/home/jeremy/.cargo/bin/op-identity-sled`, but NO process running. Projection file exists at `/dev/shm/opdbus/projections/identity_sled.json`\n- **Incus containers**: one UUID-named container `9431b9db-0e5d-f895-f43e-226352d30c8a` is RUNNING (no IP assigned); `netmaker-pro` RUNNING (100.90.37.1); all others STOPPED\n- s6 service tree running as root with many supervised services (droid-daemon, antigravity-chat, chatmanager, gbr-warp, etc.)\n- **User asking about covsw controller**: whether it is declared as `10.200.0.1` on the bridge\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Fixed `op-dbus-mirror/src/jsonrpc_interface.rs`: removed dead/duplicate code\n- Fixed `op-dbus-mirror/src/event_dispatcher.rs:152`: removed stale `MirrorEvent::NonNet` match arm\n- Fixed `op-identity/src/host_identity.rs:11`: removed unused `verify_session_proof` import\n- Fixed `op-identity/src/registration.rs:9`: removed unused `RngCore` import\n- Fixed `op-identity/src/bin/op-identity-sled.rs:3`: removed unused `read_schema_blob` import\n- Verified `cargo check -p op-dbus-mirror` and `-p op-identity` — compile cleanly\n- Explored full OVS D-Bus query pipeline architecture (3 OVSDB clients, 2 D-Bus paths, 1 netlink path)\n- Confirmed `op-openvswitch-daemon/src/dbus.rs` pure passthrough design\n- Confirmed `op-identity-sled` is NOT running; identity config dirs not found\n- Identified `collect_uuids` in `rovs_proxy.rs` correctly handles OVSDB `[\"set\", [[\"uuid\", \"...\"]]]` format\n- Found a potential bug in `op-openvswitch-daemon/src/grpc.rs:283`: `skip(1)` on `port_set` then treats each element as `[\"uuid\", ...]` but actually gets the inner array — would never match\n\n### Active\n- Investigating whether covsw controller is declared as `10.200.0.1` on the bridge — need to check OVS config/codebase for this IP assignment\n- Identity sled investigation: no running process, no identity config dir, projection file exists but identity unknown\n- Diagnosing OVS D-Bus `list_ports` not showing ports visible via `ip a show`\n\n### Blocked\n- `op-plugins/src/state_plugins/netmaker.rs:317`: async/sync mismatch — `get_node()` calls `.await` but trait `StatePlugin` method is synchronous\n- Identity sled not running — cannot determine UUID without identity config or running sled\n- Full workspace `cargo check` not yet run\n\n## Next Move\n1. Search codebase and OVS config for covsw controller IP `10.200.0.1` to answer user''s question\n2. Address cognitive MCP pieces — inventory what''s wired up vs what''s missing\n3. Investigate identity sled: why it''s not running, check s6 service logs, find identity config\n4. Fix `grpc.rs:283` port parsing bug (incorrect `skip(1)` + inner array handling)\n5. Fix `netmaker.rs` async/sync mismatch\n6. Run full workspace `cargo check`\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `crates/op-dbus-mirror/src/jsonrpc_interface.rs`: D-Bus mirror — `list_ports`, `list_bridges`\n- `crates/op-dbus-mirror/src/event_dispatcher.rs`: fixed stale NonNet match arm\n- `crates/op-openvswitch-daemon/src/dbus.rs`: OVS daemon pure passthrough\n- `crates/op-openvswitch-daemon/src/grpc.rs`: gRPC handler — **port parsing bug at line 283**\n- `crates/op-network/src/rovs_proxy.rs`: `OvsdbDbusClient` via D-Bus with `collect_uuids`\n- `crates/op-network/src/ovsdb.rs`: alternate `OvsdbClient` via raw zbus `Transact`\n- `crates/op-jsonrpc/src/ovsdb.rs`: direct JSON-RPC OVSDB client\n- `crates/op-network/src/ovs_netlink.rs`: kernel netlink OVS path\n- `crates/op-identity/src/host_identity.rs`: fixed unused import\n- `crates/op-identity/src/registration.rs`: fixed unused import\n- `crates/op-identity/src/bin/op-identity-sled.rs`: identity sled binary\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/netmaker.rs`: async/sync mismatch bug\n- `/dev/shm/opdbus/projections/identity_sled.json`: identity sled projection file\n- `/home/jeremy/.cargo/bin/op-identity-sled`: identity sled binary","time":{"start":1783669472615,"end":1783669484963}},"time":1783669484964}');
