INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_f4b007f19001ZMTKmx2ISBZb4l','ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW',912,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW","part":{"id":"prt_f4b0067c0001KFNZWuXpM8Cd17","sessionID":"ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW","messageID":"msg_f4b0060860012mvQZsAW3sSGpz","type":"reasoning","text":"Let me review the conversation history and the previous summary, then update it based on what''s new.\n\nLooking at the conversation history:\n\n1. A long file search for `qdrant-shuttle` across the repo - found it in `crates/op-cognitive-mcp/src/qdrant_shuttle.rs` and `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/cognitive_mcp.rs`\n\n2. The user made statements:\n   - `op-openvswitch-daemon` is dead/deprecated\n   - `op-dbus-mirror` is deprecated\n   - `op-network/src/rovs_proxy.rs` is deprecated and was a thin proxy wrapper\n   - Container IS the sled - that''s the whole point of `identity_sled_dispatch.rs`\n\n3. I asked about the OVS command execution path, and the user answered: \"rovs_commands plugin called directly, with method transact\" - meaning the `rovs_commands` plugin now calls `rovs` commands directly via D-Bus `Transact` method, bypassing the deprecated `OvsdbDbusClient`.\n\n4. The git diff shows a bunch of working changes (30 files modified, several new files) compared to the previous summary.\n\nLet me figure out what changed from the previous summary:\n\nNew info from conversation:\n- `op-openvswitch-daemon` confirmed dead/deprecated\n- `op-dbus-mirror` confirmed deprecated\n- `op-network/src/rovs_proxy.rs` confirmed deprecated (was thin proxy wrapper)\n- The OVS command execution path: `rovs_commands` plugin calls directly via D-Bus `Transact` - NOT through `dispatch_rovs_commands_method` with `OvsdbDbusClient`\n- This means the `dispatch_rovs_commands_method` taking `OvsdbDbusClient` is indeed the deprecated path\n\nNew files from git status:\n- `crates/op-cognitive-mcp/src/identity_source.rs` (new)\n- `crates/op-grpc-bridge/src/routing_dispatch.rs` (new)\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/routing.rs` (new)\n- `docs/routing-plugin-spec.md` (new)\n- `deploy/s6/zeroclaw-routing-uigen/` and `deploy/s6/zeroclaw-routing-uigen-log/` (new)\n- `deploy/s6/gemma/down` (new)\n\nDeleted files:\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/gemma_brain.rs` (deleted)\n\nMany files modified. Let me update the summary accordingly.","time":{"start":1783669745600,"end":1783669751576}},"time":1783669751576}');
