INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_f4b03e38b001LPYFbgjeWuLdwj','ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW',950,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW","part":{"id":"prt_f4b03d1030015OhmpcDupfW1pJ","sessionID":"ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW","messageID":"msg_f4b03baa7001B6xsfAHvZ5MfIY","type":"reasoning","text":"The user is talking about the state of the system before a reboot - the refactor worked beautifully, with the container being the identity (no loop devices, no run directories), btrfs was linked to Cozo via btrfs device add to the container. They''re saying once it''s cleaned up and working, it''s great.\n\nThey seem to be giving me context about what the system looked like before the reboot broke things. The key issues now are:\n\n1. Identity sled not running (needs WG_PUBKEY env var)\n2. Qdrant not running\n3. Gemini API key not set\n4. The `dispatch_rovs_commands_method` still uses deprecated `OvsdbDbusClient`\n5. Uncommitted changes across 30 files\n\nThe cargo check timed out. Let me try a faster approach - just check the specific crates that have uncommitted changes.","time":{"start":1783669969155,"end":1783669973898}},"time":1783669973899}');
