INSERT INTO event VALUES('evt_f4b0e2bfa001L5LhMcpmHaqdbs','ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW',1565,'message.part.updated.1','{"sessionID":"ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW","part":{"id":"prt_f4b0e15b6001dBldsH9TvTzHWW","sessionID":"ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW","messageID":"msg_f4b0e0de4001kRM7NdpHJN5vzy","type":"reasoning","text":"Let me analyze the conversation and update the summary with the new information from this session.\n\nKey new events:\n1. Confirmed gemma/ollama/ollama-srv `down` files already exist — already disabled at boot\n2. xray config.json is a **broken symlink**: `/etc/xray/config.json -> /dev/shm/xray-ghostbridge.json` (target doesn''t exist)\n3. The last working xray backup is `config.json.bak-20260707200129` which contains a real config with NextDNS and Reality inbound\n4. User mentions \"xray ridge header with nixtdns\" — they''re referring to the Reality inbound (ridge) with NextDNS in the DNS section, saying they''re not sure how it happened\n5. qdrant incus container: configured with `boot.autostart: \"true\"` and `boot.autostart.priority: \"10\"` but **fails to start** due to missing btrfs storage path: `\"/var/lib/incus/storage-pools/btrfs-pool/containers/qdrant/rootfs\"`\n6. btrfs-pool source is at `/opt/incus/storage-pool` (not `/var/lib/incus/storage-pools/btrfs-pool/`)\n7. User says \"openvswitch-daemon is also deprecated\" — already deleted in commits8. Multiple incus storage pools: `array`, `btrfs-pool` (source: `/opt/incus/storage-pool`), `default`, `netmaker-pool`\n9. qdrant container has no profile shown, devices include `ghostbridge-socket` disk mount10. xray run script: sources `/etc/ghostbridge/xray.env`, checks `/etc/xray/config.json`, aliases `10.0.0.2` on ovsbr0\n11. The xray config had Reality settings with private key `sEMA483j7RnPhQTqTcoqw5NUfuQ8TF12jc6yph_hhmc`, short IDs, and NextDNS server `https://dns.nextdns.io/689ec7/Ghostbridge-Incus`\n12. User asked \"What did we do so far?\" — wants a summary of progress","time":{"start":1783670642102,"end":1783670647802}},"time":1783670647802}');
