INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_f4af212c6001C53c9C7mpKbYL6','msg_f4af1fa1c001qDKCAT2zK9wpa9','ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW',1783668806343,1783668907259,'{"type":"tool","tool":"task","callID":"call_df12e9936e824ebb98b7700b","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"description":"Find all D-Bus interfaces","prompt":"Search the codebase at /home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto for all D-Bus interface implementations. I need to find:\n\n1. All files containing `#[interface` or `#[dbus_interface]` attributes - these are D-Bus interface implementations\n2. All files containing `#[zbus::interface` \n3. Any service definition files under `deploy/` directory\n4. Any configuration files related to interface registration\n\nFor each D-Bus interface found, report:\n- The file path and line number\n- The interface name (from the attribute)\n- The struct it''s implemented on\n- A brief list of methods exposed\n\nBe very thorough - check all crates under `crates/` and any other directories.","subagent_type":"explore"},"output":"<task id=\"ses_0b50de4a5ffe4VcC61gKDe06JR\" state=\"completed\">\n<task_result>\nNow I have all the information needed. Here is the comprehensive report.\n\n---\n\n## D-Bus Interface Implementations — Complete Report\n\n### Summary\n\nFound **26 distinct D-Bus interface implementations** across **21 source files** in the workspace. Additionally, **2 D-Bus bus configuration files** and **2 service definition config files** exist under `deploy/`.\n\n---\n\n## 1. All D-Bus Interface Implementations (by file)\n\n### A. `crates/op-dbus-mirror/` (5 interfaces)\n\n**1. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-dbus-mirror/src/dbus_interface.rs` — Line 17**\n- **Interface:** `org.opdbus.MirrorV1`\n- **Struct:** `DbusMirrorInterface`\n- **Methods:**\n  - `publish_snapshot()` — Publish a fresh snapshot from authoritative stores\n  - `reconcile()` — Compatibility alias (calls `publish_snapshot`)\n  - `get_stats()` — Get current publication statistics (JSON)\n  - `list_paths()` — Get list of all published object paths\n\n**2. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-dbus-mirror/src/object.rs` — Line 57**\n- **Interface:** `org.opdbus.ProjectedObjectV1`\n- **Struct:** `MirrorObject`\n- **Methods/Properties:**\n  - `json_data` (property) — Full JSON representation of the row\n  - `schema_json` (property) — Full PluginSchema JSON\n  - `methods` (property) — Declared method/capability surface\n  - `signals` (property) — Declared signal surface\n  - `guarantees` (property) — Declared guarantee surface\n  - `get_property(key)` — Get specific property value by key\n  - `data_updated` (signal) — Emitted when json_data changes\n\n**3. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-dbus-mirror/src/managed_objects.rs` — Line 49**\n- **Interface:** `org.freedesktop.DBus.ObjectManager`\n- **Struct:** `ObjectManagerInterface`\n- **Methods/Signals:**\n  - `get_managed_objects()` — Return every managed object with all their interface properties\n  - `interfaces_added` (signal) — Emitted when new object/interfaces appear\n  - `interfaces_removed` (signal) — Emitted when object/interfaces are removed\n\n**4. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-dbus-mirror/src/plugin_interface.rs` — Line 37**\n- **Interface:** `org.opdbus.PluginsV1`\n- **Struct:** `PluginInterface`\n- **Methods:**\n  - `list()` — Names of all registered plugins\n  - `get(name)` — Full state JSON for a single plugin\n  - `get_all()` — All plugins and their state as name-JSON map\n\n**5. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-dbus-mirror/src/jsonrpc_interface.rs` — Line 32**\n- **Interface:** `org.opdbus.mirror.OvsdbV1`\n- **Struct:** `OvsdbInterface`\n- **Methods:**\n  - `transact(operations)` — Execute JSON-RPC transact on OVSDB\n  - `get_schema()` — Get OVSDB schema (list of databases)\n  - `list_dbs()` — List OVSDB databases\n  - `dump_db()` — Dump entire database (Open_vSwitch)\n  - `create_bridge(name)` — Create bridge\n  - `delete_bridge(name)` — Delete bridge\n  - `add_port(bridge, port)` — Add port to bridge\n  - `list_bridges()` — List bridges\n  - `list_ports(bridge)` — List ports on a bridge\n\n---\n\n### B. `crates/op-projection/src/dbus_server.rs` (2 interfaces)\n\n**6. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-projection/src/dbus_server.rs` — Line 74**\n- **Interface:** `org.opdbus.v1.plugins.ProjectedObject`\n- **Struct:** `ProjectedObject`\n- **Methods/Properties:**\n  - `entity_type` (property) — Schema/entity type (plugin id or \"plugin.object\")\n  - `entity_id` (property) — Unique entity ID\n  - `state` (property) — Current projection state (always \"Valid\")\n  - `data` (property) — Full projection data as JSON string from shm\n  - `methods` (property) — Declared D-Bus methods/capabilities\n  - `signals` (property) — Declared D-Bus signals\n  - `guarantees` (property) — Declared operational guarantees\n  - `updated` (signal) — Emitted when object''s data changes\n\n**7. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-projection/src/dbus_server.rs` — Line 265**\n- **Interface:** `org.opdbus.v1.plugins`\n- **Struct:** `ProjectionRoot`\n- **Methods/Properties:**\n  - `plugins` (property) — List of plugin IDs currently projected in shm\n  - `object_count` (property) — Number of D-Bus objects currently mounted\n  - `refresh(conn)` — Re-read shm and sync the D-Bus tree\n\n---\n\n### C. `crates/op-grpc-bridge/` (4 interfaces)\n\n**8. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-grpc-bridge/src/schema_router.rs` — Line 796**\n- **Interface:** `org.opdbus.v1.PluginChildV1` (uses `#[zbus::interface]`)\n- **Struct:** `SchemaChildInterface`\n- **Methods:**\n  - `get_property(name)` — Get a property from this child object''s current SHM state\n  - `get_all_properties()` — Get all properties from current SHM state\n\n**9. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-grpc-bridge/src/schema_router.rs` — Line 996**\n- **Interface:** `org.opdbus.v1.PluginV1` (uses `#[zbus::interface]`)\n-