emove bundle + create down file + stop)\n  - `status(unit)` — Full systemd-compatible JSON status\n  - `is_active(unit)` — One-word state (\"active\"/\"inactive\"/\"unknown\")\n  - `is_enabled_method(unit)` — One-word state (\"enabled\"/\"disabled\")\n  - `show(unit)` — Dump all properties as JSON (systemctl show)\n  - `list_units()` — All active supervised services\n  - `list_unit_files()` — All available service definitions\n  - `journalctl(unit, lines)` — Retrieve logs\n  - `daemon_reload()` — Recompile s6-rc database\n  - `daemon_status()` — Is s6 available?\n  - `get_unit_type(unit)` — Runtime resolver decision\n\n---\n\n### E. `crates/op-s6-systemctl/src/dbus.rs` (1 interface)\n\n**14. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-s6-systemctl/src/dbus.rs` — Line 267**\n- **Interface:** `org.opdbus.v1.S6.Systemctl`\n- **Struct:** `S6SystemctlService`\n- **Methods:**\n  - `start(service)` — Start (s6-rc -u change)\n  - `stop(service)` — Stop (s6-rc -d change)\n  - `restart(service)` — Restart (s6 process restart)\n  - `reload(service)` — Reload (s6-svc -h)\n  - `enable(service)` — Enable (add to bundle)\n  - `disable(service)` — Disable (remove from bundle)\n  - `status(service)` — Get detailed status (JSON)\n  - `is_active(service)` — \"active\" / \"inactive\"\n  - `is_enabled(service)` — \"enabled\" / \"disabled\"\n  - `is_enabled_method(service)` — Compatibility alias\n  - `show(service)` — Service properties as JSON\n  - `list_units()` — All active units (JSON array)\n  - `list_unit_files()` — All available unit files\n  - `journalctl(service, lines)` — Retrieve logs\n  - `daemon_reload()` — Re-read s6-rc database\n  - `daemon_status()` — Supervisor status\n  - `get_unit_type(service)` — Service type\n\n---\n\n### F. `crates/op-services/src/dbus/interface.rs` (1 interface)\n\n**15. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-services/src/dbus/interface.rs` — Line 20**\n- **Interface:** `org.opdbus.services.v1.Manager`\n- **Struct:** `DbusInterface`\n- **Methods/Signals:**\n  - `start(name)` — Start a service\n  - `stop(name)` — Stop a service\n  - `restart(name)` — Restart a service\n  - `get_status(name)` — Get service status\n  - `list_services()` — List all services\n  - `service_state_changed` (signal) — Emitted on state changes\n\n---\n\n### G. `crates/op-cognitive-mcp/src/dbus_interface.rs` (1 interface)\n\n**16. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-cognitive-mcp/src/dbus_interface.rs` — Line 27**\n- **Interface:** `org.opdbus.v1.plugins.CognitiveMcp`\n- **Struct:** `CognitiveMcpInterface`\n- **Methods:**\n  - `list_tools()` — List all tools as JSON\n  - `get_tool_schema(name)` — Get tool input schema as JSON\n  - `call_tool(name, args_json)` — Call a tool with JSON arguments\n\n---\n\n### H. `crates/op-xray-daemon/src/dbus.rs` (1 interface)\n\n**17. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-xray-daemon/src/dbus.rs` — Line 94**\n- **Interface:** `opdbus.v1.Xray`\n- **Struct:** `XrayService`\n- **Methods:**\n  - `start(config_path)` — Start xray process\n  - `stop()` — Stop xray process\n  - `restart(config_path)` — Restart xray process\n  - `status()` — Current xray status as JSON\n  - `reload()` — Reload config (SIGHUP)\n  - `get_config()` — Get current config path\n\n---\n\n### I. `crates/op-openvswitch-daemon/` (4 interfaces)\n\n**18. `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto/crates/op-openvswitch-daemon/src/dbus.rs` — Line 84**\n- **Interface:** `org.opdbus.rovs.jsonrpc`\n- **Struct:** `JsonRpcService`\n- **Methods:**\n  - `transact(method, params_json)` — Execute raw OVSDB JSON-RPC transact\n  - `notify(method, params_json)` — One-way notify (fire-and-forget)\n  - `list_dbs()` — List OVSDB databases\n  - `get_schema()` — Return connected database''s schema\n  - `next_id()` — Return next JSON-RPC request id\n  - `send_message(msg)` — Send raw JSON-RPC message\n  - `recv_message()` — Receive raw JSON-RPC message\n  - `has_pending_notifications()` — Poll pending notifications\n  - `pend