INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_f4af49b65001xvmM5jsA3ZUfrA','msg_f4af4938e001xkEnR0bowWeigd','ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW',1783668972389,1783668981158,'{"type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Fix compilation errors and warnings across the operation-dbus-proto Rust workspace, then audit all D-Bus interfaces and netmaker configuration for correctness.\n\n## Important Details\n- Workspace root: `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto`\n- Netmaker plugin has a **blocking API mismatch** (`get_node()` uses `.await` but trait method is `fn` not `async fn`)\n- `op-dbus-mirror` had garbage/duplicate code blocks after a properly closed `impl` block — identified and removed\n- `MirrorEvent::NonNet` variant was removed from the enum but `event_dispatcher.rs` still referenced it\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Fixed `op-dbus-mirror/src/jsonrpc_interface.rs`: removed 55 lines of dead/duplicate code (lines 161-215) and unused imports (`JsonRpcRequest`, `serde_json::Value`)\n- Fixed `op-dbus-mirror/src/event_dispatcher.rs:152`: removed stale `MirrorEvent::NonNet` match arm\n- Fixed `op-identity/src/host_identity.rs:11`: removed unused `verify_session_proof` import\n- Fixed `op-identity/src/registration.rs:9`: removed unused `RngCore` import\n- Fixed `op-identity/src/bin/op-identity-sled.rs:3`: removed unused `read_schema_blob` import\n- Verified `cargo check -p op-dbus-mirror` — compiles cleanly, zero errors/warnings\n- Verified `cargo check -p op-identity` — compiles cleanly, zero errors/warnings\n- Discovered all 26 D-Bus interfaces across the workspace via codebase exploration\n- Discovered all netmaker-related files (plugin, adapter, deploy configs, s6 services)\n- Discovered all binary entry points and s6 service definitions\n\n### Active\n- Full workspace audit of all D-Bus interface configurations and netmaker setup (exploration agents returned results, analysis not yet presented to user)\n\n### Blocked\n- `op-plugins/src/state_plugins/netmaker.rs:317`: `get_node()` calls `.await` on `self.netmaker_client.get_node()` but the trait `StatePlugin` method is synchronous (`fn`, not `async fn`) — needs async trait or runtime blocking wrapper\n\n## Next Move\n1. Present the full D-Bus interface audit results and netmaker configuration analysis to the user\n2. Fix the `netmaker.rs` async/sync mismatch (`get_node()` in `StatePlugin` impl)\n3. Run `cargo check` on the full workspace to verify no other errors remain\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `crates/op-dbus-mirror/src/jsonrpc_interface.rs`: fixed dead code removal\n- `crates/op-dbus-mirror/src/event_dispatcher.rs`: fixed stale NonNet match arm\n- `crates/op-identity/src/host_identity.rs`: fixed unused import\n- `crates/op-identity/src/registration.rs`: fixed unused import\n- `crates/op-identity/src/bin/op-identity-sled.rs`: fixed unused import\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/netmaker.rs`: netmaker state plugin — has async/sync mismatch bug\n- `crates/op-grpc-adapters/src/adapters/netmaker.rs`: netmaker gRPC adapter (HTTP→gRPC bridge)\n- `deploy/netmaker/compose.yaml`: netmaker container stack definition (v1.6.0-ee)\n- `deploy/netmaker/install.sh`: post-provisioning script\n- `deploy/s6/wg-netmaker/run`: s6 service for netclient daemon\n- All 26 D-Bus interface files discovered across crates (op-dbus-mirror, op-plugins, op-workflows, op-deployment, op-chat, op-gateway, op-introspection, op-s6-systemctl, op-dynamic-loader, op-identity)","time":{"start":1783668972389,"end":1783668981155}}');
