`collect_uuids`\n- `crates/op-network/src/ovsdb.rs`: alternate `OvsdbClient` via raw zbus `Transact`\n- `crates/op-jsonrpc/src/ovsdb.rs`: direct JSON-RPC OVSDB client\n- `crates/op-network/src/ovs_netlink.rs`: kernel netlink OVS path\n- `crates/op-identity/src/host_identity.rs`: fixed unused import\n- `crates/op-identity/src/registration.rs`: fixed unused import\n- `crates/op-identity/src/bin/op-identity-sled.rs`: identity sled binary\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/netmaker.rs`: async/sync mismatch bug\n- `/dev/shm/opdbus/projections/identity_sled.json`: identity sled projection — **empty** `{\"sleds\":[]}`\n- `/dev/shm/opdbus/projections/zeroclaw.json`: zeroclaw projection — full config schema, zeroclaw config at `config_path`\n- `/var/lib/op-dbus/cognitive.db`: CozoDB embedded database (schema ready)\n- `/var/log/op-dbus/op-cognitive-mcp/current`: cognitive MCP logs — confirms CozoDB ready, Qdrant down, no Gemini key, identity sled not written\n- `/home/jeremy/.cargo/bin/op-identity-sled`: identity sled binary","time":{"start":1783669509315,"end":1783669526012}}');
