INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_f4aff1848001SbtW0OAtappb9Z','msg_f4aff0f920014Q3KDT0GKm79ab','ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW',1783669659720,1783669677833,'{"type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Fix compilation errors/warnings across the operation-dbus-proto Rust workspace, audit all D-Bus interfaces for correctness, diagnose why OVS ports visible via `ip a` are not returned by OVS D-Bus commands, and assess cognitive MCP system integration.\n\n## Important Details\n- Workspace root: `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto`\n- **DEPRECATED**: `OvsdbDbusClient`, `rovs_proxy`, `op-openvswitch-daemon`, `identity_sled.dat` — all replaced by direct `rovs` commands via D-Bus\n- **NEW ARCHITECTURE**: Container IS the sled (no separate identity sled binary/file); `rovs_commands` plugin in `op-plugins/src/state_plugins/rovs_commands.rs` is schema-only; execution happens in `op-grpc-bridge/src/mutation_engine.rs:dispatch_rovs_commands_method` which still calls deprecated `OvsdbDbusClient` — needs migration\n- **OVS port visibility issue**: ports show on bridge via `ip a show` but not via OVS D-Bus commands\n- **Identity sled projection**: `/dev/shm/opdbus/projections/identity_sled.json` exists but is **empty** — `{\"sleds\":[]}`, no sleds registered\n- **Zeroclaw projection**: `/dev/shm/opdbus/projections/zeroclaw.json` exists and contains substantial config schema\n- `identity_sled_dispatch.rs` doc comment: \"the container is the sled is the identity\" — persists to Cozo relations `identity_sleds` / `session_events`; provision creates Incus instance + writes sled in one mutation; sled exists ⟺ container exists\n- `identity_sled_dispatch.rs:19-23`: legacy raw sled at `/dev/shm/plugin_schema.dat` also refreshed for AnnaScribe compatibility (will be removed when AnnaScribe reads sealed blob directly)\n- **op-cognitive-mcp**: running (PID 739, up ~5326s), HTTP on `0.0.0.0:3003`, gRPC on `0.0.0.0:50052`, CozoDB embedded at `/var/lib/op-dbus/cognitive.db`\n- **Qdrant**: NOT running — no process, no port 6334; \"Qdrant Semantic Shuttle unavailable\"\n- **Identity sled**: NOT written — log warns: \"Could not read WireGuard public key — identity sled not written; set WG_PUBKEY env var to override\"\n- **Gemini fallback**: unavailable — no `GEMINI_API_KEY` or `COGNITIVE_MCP_GEMINI_API_KEY` set\n- **ovsbr0 bridge**: `10.200.0.1/30` (primary), `10.0.0.2/32` (secondary), `10.200.0.2/32` (secondary) — CozoDB on `10.200.0.1:8444`, gRPC bridge on `10.200.0.1:50051`, DNS on `10.200.0.1:53`\n- **Incus containers**: one UUID-named container `9431b9db-0e5d-f895-f43e-226352d30c8a` RUNNING (no IP); `netmaker-pro` RUNNING (100.90.37.1); all others STOPPED\n- Netmaker plugin has a **blocking API mismatch** (`get_node()` uses `.await` but trait method is `fn` not `async fn`)\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Fixed `op-dbus-mirror/src/jsonrpc_interface.rs`: removed dead/duplicate code\n- Fixed `op-dbus-mirror/src/event_dispatcher.rs:152`: removed stale `MirrorEvent::NonNet` match arm\n- Fixed `op-identity/src/host_identity.rs:11`: removed unused `verify_session_proof` import\n- Fixed `op-identity/src/registration.rs:9`: removed unused `RngCore` import\n- Fixed `op-identity/src/bin/op-identity-sled.rs:3`: removed unused `read_schema_blob` import\n- Verified `cargo check -p op-dbus-mirror` and `-p op-identity` — compile cleanly\n- Explored full OVS D-Bus query pipeline architecture (3 OVSDB clients, 2 D-Bus paths, 1 netlink path)\n- Confirmed `op-openvswitch-daemon/src/dbus.rs` pure passthrough design\n- Confirmed `op-identity-sled` is NOT running; identity config dirs not found\n- Identified `collect_uuids` in `rovs_proxy.rs` correctly handles OVSDB `[\"set\", [[\"uuid\", \"...\"]]]` format\n- Found a potential bug in `op-openvswitch-daemon/src/grpc.rs:283`: `skip(1)` on `port_set` then treats each element as `[\"uuid\", ...]` but actually gets the inner array\n- Confirmed identity sled projection is empty (`{\"sleds\":[]}`)\n- Confirmed zeroclaw projection has full config schema\n- Confirmed `op-cognitive-mcp` is running, CozoDB schema ready, listening on expected ports\n- Confirmed Qdrant vector DB is not running (no process, no port 6334)\n- Confirmed ovsbr0 bridge carries 10.200.0.1 (with CozoDB, gRPC, DNS listeners) plus 10.0.0.2 and 10.200.0.2 as secondaries\n- Traced new architecture: `rovs_commands` plugin → `mutation_engine::dispatch_rovs_commands_method` → still calls deprecated `OvsdbDbusClient` — needs update to direct `rovs` D-Bus\n- Read `identity_sled_dispatch.rs`: confirms \"container is the sled\" model, Cozo persistence, Incus provisioning, legacy compatibility path\n\n### Active\n- Diagnosing OVS D-Bus `list_ports` not showing ports visible via `ip a show`\n- Assessing cognitive MCP integration state — CozoDB and gRPC functional, but Qdrant (vector retrieval) and Gemini fallback both unavailable\n- Identity sled investigation: not running, needs `WG_PUBKEY` env var, projection empty\n\n### Blocked\n- `op-plugins/src/state_plugins/netmaker.rs:317`: async/sync mismatch — `get_node()` calls `.await` but trait `StatePlugin` method is synchronous\n- Identity sled not running — needs `WG_PUBKEY` env var to generate identity; projection remains empty\n- Qdrant not running — semantic vector retrieval unavailable for cognitive MCP\n- Gemini API key not configured — fallback unavailable\n- Full workspace `cargo check` not yet run\n- `dispatch_rovs_commands_method` in `mutation_engine.rs:1212` still takes deprecated `OvsdbDbusClient` — needs migration to direct `rovs` D-Bus calls\n- `op-dbus-mirror` still imports deprecated `OvsdbDbusClient` from `rovs_proxy` — dead code or needs migration\n\n## Next Move\n1. Migrate `dispatch_rovs_commands_method` from deprecated `OvsdbDbusClient` to direct `rovs` D-Bus calls\n2. Fix `grpc.rs:283` port parsing bug (incorrect `skip(1)` + inner array handling) — likely root cause of OVS port visibility issue\n3. Fix `netmaker.rs` async/sync mismatch\n4. Run full workspace `cargo check`\n5. Investigate starting Qdrant (or confirm it''s intentionally disabled)\n6. Determine what `WG_PUBKEY` to set for identity sled generation\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/rovs_commands.rs`: schema-only rovs_commands plugin (new architecture)\n- `crates/op-grpc-bridge/src/mutation_engine.rs`: `dispatch_rovs_commands_method` at line 1211 — still uses deprecated `OvsdbDbusClient`\n- `crates/op-grpc-bridge/src/identity_sled_dispatch.rs`: \"container is the sled\" model, Cozo persistence\n- `crates/op-dbus-mirror/src/jsonrpc_interface.rs`: D-Bus mirror — `list_ports`, `list_bridges` — still imports deprecated `OvsdbDbusClient`\n- `crates/op-dbus-mirror/src/event_dispatcher.rs`: fixed stale NonNet match arm\n- `crates/op-openvswitch-daemon/src/dbus.rs`: **DEPRECATED** OVS daemon pure passthrough\n- `crates/op-openvswitch-daemon/src/grpc.rs`: **DEPRECATED** gRPC handler — port parsing bug at line 283\n- `crates/op-network/src/rovs_proxy.rs`: **DEPRECATED** `OvsdbDbusClient` via D-Bus\n- `crates/op-network/src/ovsdb.rs`: alternate `OvsdbClient` via raw zbus `Transact`\n- `crates/op-jsonrpc/src/ovsdb.rs`: direct JSON-RPC OVSDB client\n- `crates/op-network/src/ovs_netlink.rs`: kernel netlink OVS path\n- `crates/op-identity/src/bin/op-identity-sled.rs`: **DEPRECATED** identity sled binary\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/netmaker.rs`: async/sync mismatch bug\n- `/dev/shm/opdbus/projections/identity_sled.json`: identity sled projection — **empty** `{\"sleds\":[]}`\n- `/dev/shm/opdbus/projections/zeroclaw.json`: zeroclaw projection — full config schema\n- `/var/lib/op-dbus/cognitive.db`: CozoDB embedded database (schema ready)\n- `/var/log/op-dbus/op-cognitive-mcp/current`: cognitive MCP logs","time":{"start":1783669659720,"end":1783669677830}}');
