INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_f4b08f9e2001d2iRUO5jl0jolB','msg_f4b08f105001vtVrn4FqYWLM7i','ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW',1783670307298,1783670316602,'{"type":"reasoning","text":"Let me update the anchored summary with the new information from this turn. Key new facts:\n\n1. **Git branch**: `working-tree-clean` (detached HEAD at `655d82a40`)\n2. **Latest commits**: `2022c3e94 op-grpc-bridge: remove deprecated OVS paths` and `655d82a40 op-openvswitch-daemon: remove deprecated daemon`\n3. **Deleted files** (all staged in latest commits):\n   - `crates/op-openvswitch-daemon/src/daemon.rs`\n   - `crates/op-openvswitch-daemon/src/ovs.rs`\n   - `crates/op-openvswitch-daemon/src/bin/op-openvswitch-daemon.rs`\n   - `crates/op-openvswitch-daemon/src/main.rs`\n4. **`op-grpc-bridge/src/mutation_engine.rs`**: `dispatch_rovs_commands_method` now routes through `StateEngine::get().method_call(\"rovs_commands\", ...)` directly5. **No more `OvsdbDbusClient` references** — `rovs_proxy.rs` removed, `OvsdbClient` trait only remains in `op-openvswitch-daemon` crate (which itself is deprecated)\n6. **`cognitive-mcp` changes**: `Cargo.toml` adds `base64` dep; `interceptor.rs` now uses `identity_source` module for identity resolution with legacy fallback; `identity_source.rs` is new with `populated_footprint` and `resolve_container_identity`\n7. **`qdrant_shuttle.rs`**: added `find_collection` helper for fallback collection resolution\n8. **`rag_pipeline.rs`**: `list_collections` call failure is now logged and treated as empty (not fatal)\n9. **`cognitive_mcp.rs` (state_plugins)**: collection name changed from `repomix_rag` to `repos_lsp_rust_voyage_4_large`\n10. **`incus.rs`**: container query retry loop — empty container name check now retries (previously just logged and continued)\n11. **`large_language_model.rs`**: brand-brain fallback removed from `complete_chat`; now delegates to `toolcall` plugin and falls back to HTTP12. **`wireguard.rs`**: removed 54-line manual `config_check` D-Bus method (uses `zbus` introspection)\n13. **`deploy/s6/gemma/run` and `shell_up`**: now use `zcall routing derive/publish` path with fallback to `op-gemma` binary\n14. **`deploy/s6/gemma/down`**: new file — runs `zcall routing uninvoke` to remove D-Bus object, then `zcall cache set state=routing`\n15. **`deploy/s6/zeroclaw-routing-uigen/`**: new deploy directory for routing UI generation\n16. **Untracked files**: `identity_source.rs` (1886 bytes), `down` (454 bytes), `zeroclaw-routing-uigen/` directory (3 files)\n17. **No `gemma_brain` references remain** in Rust or TOML files — complete removal confirmed","time":{"start":1783670307298,"end":1783670316598}}');
INSERT INTO part VALUES('prt_f4b091e3e001eprEN0W24wee8a','msg_f4b08f105001vtVrn4FqYWLM7i','ses_0b516ef36ffeY2Uc26WsdLIdZW',1783670316606,1783670343787,'{"type":"text","text":"## Objective\n- Fix compilation errors/warnings across the operation-dbus-proto Rust workspace, audit all D-Bus interfaces for correctness, diagnose why OVS ports visible via `ip a` are not returned by OVS D-Bus commands, and assess cognitive MCP system integration.\n\n## Important Details\n- Workspace root: `/home/jeremy/git/operation-dbus-proto`\n- **Branch**: `working-tree-clean` (detached HEAD at `655d82a40`)\n- **Latest commits**: `2022c3e94 op-grpc-bridge: remove deprecated OVS paths`, `655d82a40 op-openvswitch-daemon: remove deprecated daemon`\n- **DEPRECATED (now deleted from git)**: `OvsdbDbusClient`, `rovs_proxy`, `op-openvswitch-daemon` (daemon.rs, ovs.rs, main.rs, bin entry), `op-dbus-mirror` event dead code — all replaced by direct `rovs` commands via D-Bus or `StateEngine` plugin calls\n- **`OvsdbDbusClient` completely removed** — `mutation_engine.rs:dispatch_rovs_commands_method` now calls `StateEngine::get().method_call(\"rovs_commands\", ...)` directly\n- **`OvsdbClient` trait** still exists in `op-openvswitch-daemon` crate (which itself is deprecated/dead) — no live callers remain\n- **No more `rovs_proxy.rs`** — deleted in latest commits\n- **NEW ARCHITECTURE**: Container IS the sled (no separate identity sled binary/file); `rovs_commands` plugin is **NOT schema-only** — it has a **sealed blob** (`rovs_commands.e359cd0c2cc3b1eb.blob`) backed by its schema\n- **PRE-REBOOT STATE** (confirmed working): Container was the identity, no loop devices, no run directories, btrfs was linked to Cozo via `btrfs device add` to the container — the refactor worked beautifully\n- **OVS port visibility issue**: ports show on bridge via `ip a show` but not via OVS D-Bus commands\n- **Identity sled projection**: `/dev/shm/opdbus/projections/identity_sled.json` exists but is **empty** — `{\"sleds\":[]}`, no sleds registered\n- **op-cognitive-mcp**: running (PID 739, up ~5326s), HTTP on `0.0.0.0:3003`, gRPC on `0.0.0.0:50052`, CozoDB embedded at `/var/lib/op-dbus/cognitive.db`\n- **Qdrant**: NOT running — no process, no port 6334; \"Qdrant Semantic Shuttle unavailable\"\n- **Identity sled**: NOT written — log warns: \"Could not read WireGuard public key — identity sled not written; set WG_PUBKEY env var to override\"\n- **Gemini fallback**: unavailable — no `GEMINI_API_KEY` or `COGNITIVE_MCP_GEMINI_API_KEY` set\n- **ovsbr0 bridge**: `10.200.0.1/30` (primary), `10.0.0.2/32` (secondary), `10.200.0.2/32` (secondary) — CozoDB on `10.200.0.1:8444`, gRPC bridge on `10.200.0.1:50051`, DNS on `10.200.0.1:53`\n- **Incus containers**: one UUID-named container `9431b9db-0e5d-f895-f43e-226352d30c8a` RUNNING (no IP); `netmaker-pro` RUNNING (100.90.37.1); all others STOPPED\n- **cognitive-mcp interceptor.rs**: now uses `identity_source` module (`populated_footprint`, `resolve_container_identity`) for identity resolution with legacy raw mmap sled fallback; wireguard pubkey fallback path removed (trace-id and wireguard-pubkey handled separately)\n- **cognitive-mcp identity_source.rs**: new file (1886 bytes, untracked) — resolves container identity from D-Bus `identity_sled` property with legacy SHM mmap fallback\n- **cognitive-mcp qdrant_shuttle.rs**: added `find_collection` helper for fallback collection resolution\n- **cognitive-mcp rag_pipeline.rs**: `list_collections` failure now logged and treated as empty (not fatal)\n- **cognitive_mcp state plugin**: default collection changed from `repomix_rag` to `repos_lsp_rust_voyage_4_large`\n- **large_language_model.rs**: brand-brain fallback removed from `complete_chat`; now delegates to `toolcall` plugin and falls back to HTTP\n- **incus.rs**: container query retry loop — empty container name check now retries (previously just logged and continued)\n- **wireguard.rs**: removed 54-line manual `config_check` D-Bus method (uses `zbus` introspection instead)\n- **deploy/s6/gemma/run, shell_up**: now use `zcall routing derive/publish` path (D-Bus object → SHM) with fallback to `op-gemma` binary\n- **deploy/s6/gemma/down**: new file — runs `zcall routing uninvoke` to remove D-Bus object, then `zcall cache set state=routing`\n- **deploy/s6/zeroclaw-routing-uigen/**: new deploy directory for routing UI generation (3 files: down, producer-for, run, type)\n- **gemma_brain fully removed**: no references remain in Rust or TOML files — confirmed via `rg`\n\n## Work State\n### Completed\n- Deleted `gemma_brain.rs` (384 lines) — replaced by routing plugin; cleaned `mod.rs` and `plugin_scaffold_helpers.rs`\n- Deleted `OvsdbDbusClient` and `OvsdbDbusClientInner` from `mutation_engine.rs` (~140 lines) — `dispatch_rovs_commands_method` now calls `StateEngine::get().method_call(\"rovs_commands\", ...)`\n- Deleted `rovs_proxy.rs` — no longer needed\n- Deleted `op-openvswitch-daemon` daemon/ovs/bin/main source files (staged in `655d82a40`)\n- Added `routing.rs`, `routing_dispatch.rs`, `routing_plugin_schema` re-export\n- Added routing dispatch in `mutation_engine.rs` (mutate path + dispatch switch)\n- Fixed `jsonrpc_interface.rs`: removed dead code (57 lines orphaned struct/impl)\n- Fixed `event_dispatcher.rs:152`: removed stale `MirrorEvent::NonNet` match arm\n- Fixed `host_identity.rs:11`, `registration.rs:9`, `op-identity-sled.rs:3`: removed unused imports\n- `cargo check -p op-dbus-mirror` and `-p op-identity` verified clean\n- Confirmed `op-openvswitch-daemon/src/dbus.rs` pure passthrough design (now dead)\n- Confirmed `op-identity-sled` is NOT running; identity config dirs not found\n- Identified `collect_uuids` in `rovs_proxy.rs` correctly handles OVSDB format (now deleted)\n- Found port parsing bug in `grpc.rs:283` (`skip(1)` + inner array) — now dead code in deprecated crate\n- Confirmed identity sled projection is empty (`{\"sleds\":[]}`)\n- Confirmed zeroclaw projection has full config schema\n- Confirmed ovsbr0 bridge carries 10.200.0.1 (with CozoDB, gRPC, DNS listeners) plus 10.0.0.2 and 10.200.0.2\n- Confirmed `rovs_commands` sealed blob exists at `/dev/shm/opdbus/plugin-blobs/rovs_commands.e359cd0c2cc3b1eb.blob`\n- Verified all uncommitted diffs via `git diff HEAD` — changes consistent with refactor\n- Deleted all deprecated OVS paths from `op-grpc-bridge/src/lib.rs` (imports, trait impl, re-exports)\n- Cleaned up `main.rs` to remove daemon references\n\n### Active\n- Uncommitted changes: `op-grpc-bridge/src/lib.rs`, `main.rs`, `mutation_engine.rs`, plus cognitive-mcp changes and deploy script updates\n- Untracked files: `identity_source.rs`, `down`, `zeroclaw-routing-uigen/` directory\n- Diagnosing OVS D-Bus `list_ports` not showing ports visible via `ip a show`\n- Assessing cognitive MCP integration — CozoDB and gRPC functional, Qdrant and Gemini fallback unavailable\n- Identity sled investigation: not running, needs `WG_PUBKEY` env var, projection empty\n\n### Blocked\n- `op-plugins/src/state_plugins/netmaker.rs:317`: async/sync mismatch — `get_node()` calls `.await` but trait `StatePlugin` method is synchronous\n- Identity sled not running — needs `WG_PUBKEY` env var to generate identity; projection remains empty\n- Qdrant not running — semantic vector retrieval unavailable for cognitive MCP\n- Gemini API key not configured — fallback unavailable\n- Full workspace `cargo check` attempted but timed out (180s)\n- Deprecated `op-openvswitch-daemon` crate still exists in Cargo.toml workspace members (source files deleted but crate shell remains)\n\n## Next Move\n1. Commit the remaining uncommitted changes (`lib.rs`, `main.rs`, `mutation_engine.rs` cleanup, cognitive-mcp updates, deploy scripts)\n2. Remove `op-openvswitch-daemon` from workspace `Cargo.toml` members list (source deleted, crate shell still referenced)\n3. Fix `netmaker.rs` async/sync mismatch\n4. Investigate starting Qdrant (or confirm it''s intentionally disabled)\n5. Determine what `WG_PUBKEY` to set for identity sled generation\n6. Reboot and verify container = identity with btrfs device add to Cozo\n\n## Relevant Files\n- `crates/op-grpc-bridge/src/mutation_engine.rs`: `dispatch_rovs_commands_method` — now uses `StateEngine::method_call(\"rovs_commands\", ...)` directly (no more `OvsdbDbusClient`)\n- `crates/op-grpc-bridge/src/lib.rs`: uncommitted — removed deprecated OVS imports, trait impl, re-exports\n- `crates/op-grpc-bridge/src/main.rs`: uncommitted — cleaned daemon references\n- `crates/op-grpc-bridge/src/routing_dispatch.rs`: routing dispatch (new)\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/routing.rs`: routing plugin (new)\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/gemma_brain.rs`: **deleted** — fully removed, no references remain\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/mod.rs`: removed `gemma_brain`, added `routing`\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/plugin_scaffold_helpers.rs`: removed `gemma_brain_schema`, added `routing_schema`\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/cognitive_mcp.rs`: collection name `repomix_rag` → `repos_lsp_rust_voyage_4_large`\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/incus.rs`: retry on empty container name\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/large_language_model.rs`: removed brand-brain fallback\n- `crates/op-plugins/src/state_plugins/netmaker.rs`: async/sync mismatch bug\n- `crates/op-cognitive-mcp/src/identity_source.rs`: **new** (untracked) — container identity resolution\n- `crates/op-cognitive-mcp/src/interceptor.rs`: expanded with identity_source integration\n- `crates/op-cognitive-mcp/src/qdrant_shuttle.rs`: added `find_collection` helper\n- `crates/op-cognitive-mcp/src/rag_pipeline.rs`: `list_collections` failure now non-fatal\n- `crates/op-cognitive-mcp/Cargo.toml`: added `base64` dependency\n- `crates/op-web/src/wireguard.rs`: removed manual `config_check` D-Bus method\n- `docs/routing-plugin-spec.md`: routing plugin spec (new)\n- `deploy/s6/gemma/run`: now uses `zcall routing derive/publish` with fallback\n- `deploy/s6/gemma/shell_up`: same zcall routing pattern\n- `deploy/s6/gemma/down`: **new** — `zcall routing uninvoke` + cache state\n- `deploy/s6/zeroclaw-routing-uigen/`: **new** deploy directory\n- `/dev/shm/opdbus/projections/identity_sled.json`: **empty** `{\"sleds\":[]}`\n- `/dev/shm/opdbus/projections/zeroclaw.json`: full config schema\n- `/dev/shm/opdbus/plugin-blobs/rovs_commands.e359cd0c2cc3b1eb.blob`: rovs_commands sealed blob\n- `/var/lib/op-dbus/cognitive.db`: CozoDB embedded database\n- `crates/op-openvswitch-daemon/`: **deprecated** — source files deleted, crate shell still in workspace","time":{"start":1783670316606,"end":1783670343784}}');
