.rs 2>/dev/null | head -20\necho \"===\"\ngrep -rn \"qdrant\\|6334\\|6333\" crates/op-cognitive-mcp/src/main.rs 2>/dev/null | head -20","time":{"start":1783670993470,"end":1783670993478}}}');
